  "hypotheses": [
    "A parsed and reconstructed QMP boundary can expose an exact observation-only allowlist while handling client qmp_capabilities locally and default-denying every other command.",
    "Mutation, fd-injection, malformed JSON, OOB, oversized-frame and SCM_RIGHTS attempts must not reach the QEMU backend or change the PCI tree or process fd state.",
    "Every client request must have a bounded audit record tied to peer credentials, policy hash and request digest, while every backend send has separate attempt and outcome records.",
    "This component result is only a premise for the production S15/F09 bypass gates and cannot close product state without launcher, lease, VFIO and alternate-channel integration."
